OL,3,CDeath of Taylor Charlton 'no longer
OL,4,Cdeemed suspicious'
OL,6,FTwo people arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fthe murder of a teenager from
OL,8,FBarnstaple have been released without
OL,9,Fcharge as police are no longer
OL,10,Ftreating the death of suspicious.
OL,12,FTaylor was last seen in Barnstaple on
OL,13,Fthe evening of 8 May and his remains
OL,14,Fwere found in the River Taw in June.
OL,16,FA man aged in his 20s and a woman aged
OL,17,Fin her 40s were arrested by detectives
OL,18,Fon suspicion of murder following
OL,19,FTaylor's disappearance. They have now
OL,20,Fboth been released with no further
OL,21,Faction.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
