OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786967344
OL,3,CDeath of Taylor Charlton 'no longer
OL,4,Cdeemed suspicious'
OL,6,FSenior Investigating Officer Detective
OL,7,FInspector Elaine Westerman said:
OL,8,F"These arrests were made as part of
OL,9,Four commitment to fully investigating
OL,10,Fall avenues of enquiry and leaving no
OL,11,Fstone unturned in finding answers for
OL,12,FTaylor's family.
OL,14,F"Following a full and thorough
OL,15,Finvestigation, we are satisfied that
OL,16,Fneither of these individuals have had
OL,17,Fany involvement in Taylor's
OL,18,Fdisappearance or death.
OL,26,@pD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786967344
OL,3,CDeath of Taylor Charlton 'no longer
OL,4,Cdeemed suspicious'
OL,6,F"There is currently no indication of
OL,7,Fany third-party involvement in
OL,8,FTaylor's death, which is not being
OL,9,Ftreated as suspicious. A file will now
OL,10,Fbe prepared for HM Coroner.
OL,12,F"Taylor's family have been updated on
OL,13,Fthese developments and continue to be
OL,14,Fsupported by specially-trained
OL,15,Fofficers.
OL,17,F"Our thoughts and sympathies remain
OL,18,Fwith them along with Taylor's friends
OL,19,Fand the local community.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
